        kind: 'faded',
        text: 'A region has 3 team-years of substation engineering this year. Three candidates:\nP: €6 million, unlocks 20 MW from the queue, needs 3 team-years.\nQ: €2 million, unlocks 6 MW, needs 1 team-year.\nR: €4 million, lowers the risk of an old station by €250,000 a year for 40 years; needs 1.5 team-years.\n\nDiscount rate 4%; the present-value factor for 40 years is 19.79.',
        ask: 'What would you do now?',
